  "description": "Local-first OCR, Named Entity Recognition, and Vision captioning library. Uses Tesseract OCR, BERT NER (ONNX), Florence-2 vision, and ImageSharp preprocessing. Auto-downloads all models on first use - zero manual setup required.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
